  "translation": "Today morning, Xiao Ming got up at seven o'clock. He first went to the bathroom to wash his face. Then he ate breakfast in the kitchen. Mom made the steamed buns and milk. Xiao Ming also ate two steamed buns. He thought they were very delicious. After breakfast, Xiao Ming carried his schoolbag to go to school. His home was not far from school, so he walked there. On the way, he saw three cats sleeping under a tree. Xiao Ming said, 'These cats are really lazy!' After he arrived at school, his classmate Xiao Li asked him, 'What did you eat this morning?' Xiao Ming said, 'I ate steamed buns and milk. Have you eaten?' Xiao Li said, 'I haven't eaten yet.' Xiao Ming said, 'Then go eat now.' Class was going on, and the Chinese teacher walked into the classroom. She asked, 'Who can read this Chinese character?' Xiao Ming raised his hand and said, 'I can!' He read it once, and the teacher said, 'Very good!' Xiao Ming was very happy. At noon, Xiao Ming and Xiao Li ate lunch together."
}
